WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.180
Chris Gore of Film Threat: The film just blew my&nbsp;
mind, three-hour epic, very loosely based on two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:12.420
historical figures and it has everything&nbsp;
Hollywood movies wish they had today.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:20.460
Just compelling, instantly likable characters. It&nbsp;
very much felt like an old style Hollywood movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:26.400
a mix of you know yes there are dance&nbsp;
numbers, there's also romance and humor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.680
action, there's heroism, acts of&nbsp;
self-sacrifice. I don't know that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:39.180
Hollywood can make a film like RRR movie&nbsp;
and it's really disappointing to me.

